{%- comment -%}
  ca-head.liquid — Conspire Agency's single injection point into <head>.

  This is the ONE place custom head code hooks into the theme. It is rendered
  once from layout/theme.liquid via {%- render 'ca-head' -%}. Add all custom
  head assets and Liquid partials here so upstream (Shopify) theme files stay
  untouched and merge cleanly.

  Loaded AFTER Shopify's theme-styles-variables and color-palette, so anything
  here wins on CSS specificity / cascade order.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} Custom CSS variables driven by Liquid / theme settings {%- endcomment -%}
{%- render 'ca-theme-variables' -%}

{%- comment -%} Static custom styles and scripts {%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'ca-custom.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'ca-custom.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
